kwin: kwin (KDE Plasma Wayland Compositor)
kwin:
kwin: KWin is an easy to use, but flexible, compositor for Wayland on Linux.
kwin: Its primary usage is in conjunction with a Desktop Shell. KWin is
kwin: designed to stay out of the way; users should not notice that they use
kwin: a window manager at all.
